[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6903.189, "timestamp": "01:55:03", "text": "待って、何時の時間ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6905.91, "timestamp": "01:55:05", "text": "午前1時半くらいだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6908.709, "timestamp": "01:55:08", "text": "ああ、しまった、忘れてた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6912.55, "timestamp": "01:55:12", "text": "ええ、いつ寝るんですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6914.149, "timestamp": "01:55:14", "text": "ええと、そうであるはずです。12時頃まで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6920.47, "timestamp": "01:55:20", "text": "シェフがいるので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6925.03, "timestamp": "01:55:25", "text": "明日は学校がありません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6928.229, "timestamp": "01:55:28", "text": "学校はあるけど、午後から"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6930.55, "timestamp": "01:55:30", "text": "夕方にかけての時間帯なんだ。   だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6943.27, "timestamp": "01:55:43", "text": "ブループロトコルはどうですか？ はぁ？  [鼻を鳴らす]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6943.99, "timestamp": "01:55:43", "text": "あの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6945.35, "timestamp": "01:55:45", "text": "試合見てたの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6947.51, "timestamp": "01:55:47", "text": "ああ、[笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6951.75, "timestamp": "01:55:51", "text": "私はこのゲームをプレイしてきました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6954.95, "timestamp": "01:55:54", "text": "ええ、もう支払いましたよ。 だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6957.35, "timestamp": "01:55:57", "text": "お金に見合うだけの価値を得なければならない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6959.445, "timestamp": "01:55:59", "text": "難しいですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6959.91, "timestamp": "01:55:59", "text": "[笑い]"}]